Project Information:
- Name: MOGWAI (Modern Object-oriented Gateway With Artificial Intelligence)
- Version: 8.0
- Author: Stéphane Sibué
- Website: https://coding4phone.com
- Repository: https://github.com/Sydney680928/mogwai
- Package: https://www.nuget.org/packages/MOGWAI

Description:
MOGWAI is a stack-based RPN (Reverse Polish Notation) scripting language
designed for industrial IoT automation, embedded systems, and creative
programming. Inspired by HP calculators (HP 28S, HP 48), MOGWAI brings
the elegance of RPN to modern .NET applications.

History:
Originally created in 2015 to simulate Bluetooth Low Energy devices for
IoT testing, MOGWAI evolved over 10 years into a full-featured scripting
language with 300+ built-in functions. The language has been battle-tested
in production environments for industrial automation and public lighting
systems.

